    "body": "Pushed a164293c: `the_tool_list_page_is_laid_out_in_groups_like_the_wcs_page` now asserts the full header row of both tables through `assert_header_row`. The tools table is T, Tool, Size, Ops and the time readout is Tool, Ops, Changes, Cut, Rapid, Est (min). Each header has to appear once inside its group, all on one row, in order from left to right.\n\nMutation check: I deleted each of the 10 headers in turn (all 6 readout headers and all 4 tools-table headers). The test failed every time and passed again once the header was restored.\n\nGate: ui lib, single-threaded: 676 passed, 0 failed. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean. No snapshot PNGs changed.\n\nReady for a re-check.",
