    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: a164293c5ed70a79de90749f4fe66420d0776cb7 -->\n**Delta re-check @ a164293c** (test-only, since 6c0c62c6): **clean**, `merge-ready`.\n\n- `assert_header_row` pins every header of both tables:\n  - the tools table: T, Tool, Size, Ops;\n  - the readout: Tool, Ops, Changes, Cut, Rapid, Est (min).\n- Each header must appear exactly once between its group's title and the next one, all on one row (within 2 px) and in left-to-right order. Dropping, duplicating, moving or reordering a column turns the pin red. This closes the earlier non-blocking note, where dropping Rapid, Tool, Ops, Changes or Cut stayed green.\n- No product code changed. The screenshots are still owed to the body, per #1440.\n",
